[
  {
    "content_id": "10048001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作使徒的保罗（不是由于人，也不是借着人，乃是借着耶稣基督，与叫他从死里复活的父　神）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;和一切与我同在的众弟兄，写信给加拉太的各教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;愿恩惠、平安从父　神与我们的主耶稣基督归与你们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;基督照我们父　神的旨意，为我们的罪舍己，要救我们脱离这罪恶的世代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;但愿荣耀归于　神，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我希奇你们这么快离开那借着基督之恩召你们的，去从别的福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;那并不是福音，不过有些人搅扰你们，要把基督的福音更改了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;但无论是我们，是天上来的使者，若传福音给你们，与我们所传给你们的不同，他就应当被咒诅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我们已经说了，现在又说，若有人传福音给你们，与你们所领受的不同，他就应当被咒诅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我现在是要得人的心呢？还是要得　神的心呢？我岂是讨人的喜欢吗？若仍旧讨人的喜欢，我就不是基督的仆人了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我告诉你们，我素来所传的福音不是出于人的意思。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;因为我不是从人领受的，也不是人教导我的，乃是从耶稣基督启示来的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们听见我从前在犹太教中所行的事，怎样极力逼迫残害　神的教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我又在犹太教中，比我本国许多同岁的人更有长进，为我祖宗的遗传更加热心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;然而，那把我从母腹里分别出来、又施恩召我的　神，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;既然乐意将他儿子启示在我心里，叫我把他传在外邦人中，我就没有与属血气的人商量，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;也没有上耶路撒冷去见那些比我先作使徒的，惟独往阿拉伯去，后又回到大马士革。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;过了三年，才上耶路撒冷去见矶法，和他同住了十五天。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;至于别的使徒，除了主的兄弟雅各，我都没有看见。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我写给你们的不是谎话，这是我在　神面前说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;以后我到了叙利亚和基利家境内。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;那时，犹太信基督的各教会都没有见过我的面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;不过听说那从前逼迫我们的，现在传扬他原先所残害的真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;他们就为我的缘故，归荣耀给　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;过了十四年，我同巴拿巴又上耶路撒冷去，并带着提多同去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我是奉启示上去的，把我在外邦人中所传的福音对弟兄们陈说；却是背地里对那有名望之人说的，惟恐我现在，或是从前，徒然奔跑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;但与我同去的提多，虽是希腊人，也没有勉强他受割礼；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因为有偷着引进来的假弟兄，私下窥探我们在基督耶稣里的自由，要叫我们作奴仆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我们就是一刻的工夫也没有容让顺服他们，为要叫福音的真理仍存在你们中间。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;至于那些有名望的，不论他是何等人，都与我无干。　神不以外貌取人。那些有名望的，并没有加增我什么，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;反倒看见了主托我传福音给那未受割礼的人，正如托彼得传福音给那受割礼的人。（</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那感动彼得、叫他为受割礼之人作使徒的，也感动我，叫我为外邦人作使徒；）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;又知道所赐给我的恩典，那称为教会柱石的雅各、矶法、约翰，就向我和巴拿巴用右手行相交之礼，叫我们往外邦人那里去，他们往受割礼的人那里去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;只是愿意我们记念穷人；这也是我本来热心去行的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;后来，矶法到了安提阿；因他有可责之处，我就当面抵挡他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;从雅各那里来的人未到以先，他和外邦人一同吃饭，及至他们来到，他因怕奉割礼的人，就退去与外邦人隔开了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;其余的犹太人也都随着他装假，甚至连巴拿巴也随伙装假。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但我一看见他们行的不正，与福音的真理不合，就在众人面前对矶法说：「你既是犹太人，若随外邦人行事，不随犹太人行事，怎么还勉强外邦人随犹太人呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我们这生来的犹太人，不是外邦的罪人；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;既知道人称义不是因行律法，乃是因信耶稣基督，连我们也信了基督耶稣，使我们因信基督称义，不因行律法称义；因为凡有血气的，没有一人因行律法称义。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我们若求在基督里称义，却仍旧是罪人，难道基督是叫人犯罪的吗？断乎不是！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我素来所拆毁的，若重新建造，这就证明自己是犯罪的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我因律法，就向律法死了，叫我可以向　神活着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我已经与基督同钉十字架，现在活着的不再是我，乃是基督在我里面活着；并且我如今在肉身活着，是因信　神的儿子而活；他是爱我，为我舍己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我不废掉　神的恩；义若是借着律法得的，基督就是徒然死了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;无知的加拉太人哪，耶稣基督钉十字架，已经活画在你们眼前，谁又迷惑了你们呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我只要问你们这一件：你们受了圣灵，是因行律法呢？是因听信福音呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们既靠圣灵入门，如今还靠肉身成全吗？你们是这样的无知吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们受苦如此之多，都是徒然的吗？难道果真是徒然的吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那赐给你们圣灵，又在你们中间行异能的，是因你们行律法呢？是因你们听信福音呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;正如「亚伯拉罕信　神，这就算为他的义」。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们要知道：那以信为本的人，就是亚伯拉罕的子孙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;并且圣经既然预先看明，　神要叫外邦人因信称义，就早已传福音给亚伯拉罕，说：「万国都必因你得福。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;可见那以信为本的人和有信心的亚伯拉罕一同得福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;凡以行律法为本的，都是被咒诅的；因为经上记着：「凡不常照律法书上所记一切之事去行的，就被咒诅。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;没有一个人靠着律法在　神面前称义，这是明显的；因为经上说：「义人必因信得生。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;律法原不本乎信，只说：「行这些事的，就必因此活着。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;基督既为我们受了咒诅，就赎出我们脱离律法的咒诅；因为经上记着：「凡挂在木头上都是被咒诅的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;这便叫亚伯拉罕的福，因基督耶稣可以临到外邦人，使我们因信得着所应许的圣灵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我且照着人的常话说：虽然是人的文约，若已经立定了，就没有能废弃或加增的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;所应许的原是向亚伯拉罕和他子孙说的。　神并不是说「众子孙」，指着许多人，乃是说「你那一个子孙」，指着一个人，就是基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我是这么说，　神预先所立的约，不能被那四百三十年以后的律法废掉，叫应许归于虚空。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因为承受产业，若本乎律法，就不本乎应许；但　神是凭着应许把产业赐给亚伯拉罕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;这样说来，律法是为什么有的呢？原是为过犯添上的，等候那蒙应许的子孙来到，并且是借天使经中保之手设立的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;但中保本不是为一面作的；　神却是一位。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;这样，律法是与　神的应许反对吗？断乎不是！若曾传一个能叫人得生的律法，义就诚然本乎律法了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但圣经把众人都圈在罪里，使所应许的福因信耶稣基督，归给那信的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;但这因信得救的理还未来以先，我们被看守在律法之下，直圈到那将来的真道显明出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;这样，律法是我们训蒙的师傅，引我们到基督那里，使我们因信称义。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;但这因信得救的理既然来到，我们从此就不在师傅的手下了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们因信基督耶稣都是　神的儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;你们受洗归入基督的都是披戴基督了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;并不分犹太人、希腊人，自主的、为奴的，或男或女，因为你们在基督耶稣里都成为一了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;你们既属乎基督，就是亚伯拉罕的后裔，是照着应许承受产业的了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我说那承受产业的，虽然是全业的主人，但为孩童的时候却与奴仆毫无分别，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;乃在师傅和管家的手下，直等他父亲预定的时候来到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们为孩童的时候，受管于世俗小学之下，也是如此。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;及至时候满足，　神就差遣他的儿子，为女子所生，且生在律法以下，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;要把律法以下的人赎出来，叫我们得着儿子的名分。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们既为儿子，　神就差他儿子的灵进入你们的心，呼叫：「阿爸！父！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;可见，从此以后，你不是奴仆，乃是儿子了；既是儿子，就靠着　神为后嗣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;但从前你们不认识　神的时候，是给那些本来不是神的作奴仆；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;现在你们既然认识　神，更可说是被　神所认识的，怎么还要归回那懦弱无用的小学，情愿再给他作奴仆呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们谨守日子、月份、节期、年份，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我为你们害怕，惟恐我在你们身上是枉费了工夫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我劝你们要像我一样，因为我也像你们一样。你们一点没有亏负我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们知道我头一次传福音给你们，是因为身体有疾病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们为我身体的缘故受试炼，没有轻看我，也没有厌弃我，反倒接待我，如同　神的使者，如同基督耶稣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们当日所夸的福气在哪里呢？那时你们若能行，就是把自己的眼睛剜出来给我，也都情愿。这是我可以给你们作见证的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;如今我将真理告诉你们，就成了你们的仇敌吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;那些人热心待你们，却不是好意，是要离间你们，叫你们热心待他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;在善事上，常用热心待人原是好的，却不单我与你们同在的时候才这样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我小子啊，我为你们再受生产之苦，直等到基督成形在你们心里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我巴不得现今在你们那里，改换口气，因我为你们心里作难。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们这愿意在律法以下的人，请告诉我，你们岂没有听见律法吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;因为律法上记着，亚伯拉罕有两个儿子，一个是使女生的，一个是自主之妇人生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;然而，那使女所生的是按着血气生的；那自主之妇人所生的是凭着应许生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;这都是比方：那两个妇人就是两约。一约是出于西奈山，生子为奴，乃是夏甲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;这夏甲二字是指着阿拉伯的西奈山，与现在的耶路撒冷同类，因耶路撒冷和她的儿女都是为奴的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;但那在上的耶路撒冷是自主的，她是我们的母。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;因为经上记着： 不怀孕、不生养的，你要欢乐； 未曾经过产难的，你要高声欢呼； 因为没有丈夫的，比有丈夫的儿女更多。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我们是凭着应许作儿女，如同以撒一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;当时，那按着血气生的逼迫了那按着圣灵生的，现在也是这样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;然而经上是怎么说的呢？是说：「把使女和她儿子赶出去！因为使女的儿子不可与自主妇人的儿子一同承受产业。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，这样看来，我们不是使女的儿女，乃是自主妇人的儿女了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;基督释放了我们，叫我们得以自由。所以要站立得稳，不要再被奴仆的轭挟制。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我—保罗告诉你们，若受割礼，基督就与你们无益了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我再指着凡受割礼的人确实地说，他是欠着行全律法的债。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们这要靠律法称义的，是与基督隔绝，从恩典中坠落了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我们靠着圣灵，凭着信心，等候所盼望的义。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;原来在基督耶稣里，受割礼不受割礼全无功效，惟独使人生发仁爱的信心才有功效。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们向来跑得好，有谁拦阻你们，叫你们不顺从真理呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;这样的劝导不是出于那召你们的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;一点面酵能使全团都发起来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我在主里很信你们必不怀别样的心；但搅扰你们的，无论是谁，必担当他的罪名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我若仍旧传割礼，为什么还受逼迫呢？若是这样，那十字架讨厌的地方就没有了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;恨不得那搅乱你们的人把自己割绝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，你们蒙召是要得自由，只是不可将你们的自由当作放纵情欲的机会，总要用爱心互相服事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;因为全律法都包在「爱人如己」这一句话之内了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们要谨慎，若相咬相吞，只怕要彼此消灭了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我说，你们当顺着圣灵而行，就不放纵肉体的情欲了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因为情欲和圣灵相争，圣灵和情欲相争，这两个是彼此相敌，使你们不能做所愿意做的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;但你们若被圣灵引导，就不在律法以下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;情欲的事都是显而易见的，就如奸淫、污秽、邪荡、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拜偶像、邪术、仇恨、争竞、忌恨、恼怒、结党、纷争、异端、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;嫉妒、醉酒、荒宴等类。我从前告诉你们，现在又告诉你们，行这样事的人必不能承受　神的国。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;圣灵所结的果子，就是仁爱、喜乐、和平、忍耐、恩慈、良善、信实、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;温柔、节制。这样的事没有律法禁止。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;凡属基督耶稣的人，是已经把肉体连肉体的邪情私欲同钉在十字架上了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我们若是靠圣灵得生，就当靠圣灵行事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;不要贪图虚名，彼此惹气，互相嫉妒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，若有人偶然被过犯所胜，你们属灵的人就当用温柔的心把他挽回过来；又当自己小心，恐怕也被引诱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们各人的重担要互相担当，如此，就完全了基督的律法。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;人若无有，自己还以为有，就是自欺了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;各人应当察验自己的行为；这样，他所夸的就专在自己，不在别人了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因为各人必担当自己的担子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;在道理上受教的，当把一切需用的供给施教的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;不要自欺，　神是轻慢不得的。人种的是什么，收的也是什么。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;顺着情欲撒种的，必从情欲收败坏；顺着圣灵撒种的，必从圣灵收永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我们行善，不可丧志；若不灰心，到了时候就要收成。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以，有了机会就当向众人行善，向信徒一家的人更当这样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;请看我亲手写给你们的字是何等的大呢！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;凡希图外貌体面的人都勉强你们受割礼，无非是怕自己为基督的十字架受逼迫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他们那些受割礼的，连自己也不守律法；他们愿意你们受割礼，不过要借着你们的肉体夸口。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但我断不以别的夸口，只夸我们主耶稣基督的十字架；因这十字架，就我而论，世界已经钉在十字架上；就世界而论，我已经钉在十字架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;受割礼不受割礼都无关紧要，要紧的就是作新造的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;凡照此理而行的，愿平安、怜悯加给他们，和　神的以色列民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;从今以后，人都不要搅扰我，因为我身上带着耶稣的印记。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，愿我主耶稣基督的恩常在你们心里。阿们！</p>"
  }
]